      "en": "The Aqua Marina Steam 312 (ST-312) is a premium solo inflatable kayak for touring and mild whitewater — welded reinforced-PVC tubes with a removable 7 cm drop-stitch high-pressure floor for rigidity and responsive handling. At 312 cm × 90 cm and 11.5 kg with 110 kg max load, its streamlined hull tracks well with twin centre fins. Self-bailing drain valves suit river and coastal use; Deck Shield, cargo bungees, and adjustable footrest add comfort. Package typically includes premium seat, pump, fins, 10 L dry bag, and zip backpack.",
